window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-031-61cd230d3d48bf4b.json"]={sha256:"61cd230d3d48bf4bbe9c9a46996bc9164692904c335368052d58dda71f11fe18",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-68954da34932ecc4","url":"https://github.com/in-toto/specification/blob/master/in-toto-spec.md","title":"in-toto specification: steps, thresholds and artifact rules","titleEn":"in-toto specification: steps, thresholds and artifact rules","publisher":"in-toto","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-031","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-031","related":[{"id":"security-v27-032","referenceUrls":["https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-provenance"],"title":"SLSA v1.2：建置類型、外部參數與解析相依綁定","titleEn":"SLSA v1.2: binding build type, external parameters and resolved dependencies","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：20%與10%可重算，剩餘未核准產物仍使步驟失敗；重複同keyid不增加獨立門檻。 交付intoto-rule-queue.csv、功能者矩陣與規則順序反例；簽章驗證以公開測試鍵或明示描述代替正式簽章。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 20 and ten percent, fail the step while unapproved products remain, and never increase the independent threshold count with repeated evidence from one key. Deliver intoto-rule-queue.csv, the functionary matrix and ordering counterexamples. Use public test keys or explicitly labeled verification descriptors rather than production signatures.","difference":"建立12筆已驗證簽章的來源描述，列subject摘要、buildType、externalParameters及resolvedDependencies；為核准來源分支、目標與相依摘要寫明本地契約。","differenceEn":"Build 12 signature-verified provenance descriptors with subject digest, buildType, externalParameters and resolvedDependencies. Define local expectations for source revision, target and dependency digest before evaluating the records.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["功能者門檻與產物規則是獨立關卡；本課計算未核准產物佔比，所有名稱先正規化且不把同一路徑不同摘要合併。 單一步驟輸出10個產物，其中8個被明訂規則消耗，2個剩餘；兩位有效功能者已滿足門檻且內容一致。 剩餘比例(10−8)/10×100=20%；補上一條僅核准其中一個既定產物的精確規則後剩10%。","v1.2規格的build provenance使用v1 predicate類型；buildType決定參數語意，未知類型不能用猜測欄位規則通過。課堂准入是本地政策，不自動授予SLSA等級。 12筆中10筆主體與builder符合，當中7筆參數及解析相依皆符合；其餘列分別標明未核准目標或相依摘要。 完整契約通過率7/12×100≈58.333%；補正兩筆已通過其他關卡的相依解析證據後為9/12×100=75%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Functionary threshold and artifact rules are independent gates. Measure the fraction of unapproved products after path normalization, while retaining different digests for an identical path rather than merging conflicting evidence into a single harmless-looking entry. One step emits ten products, eight consumed by explicit rules and two remaining. Two valid functionaries already satisfy the threshold and agree on contents, isolating artifact-policy completeness from signer-count failure. Remaining fraction is (10−8)/10×100=20 percent. Adding an exact rule approving only one previously reviewed product leaves ten percent, and the final DISALLOW still rejects the remaining unexpected output.","The v1.2 build-provenance specification uses the v1 predicate type. buildType defines parameter semantics, so an unknown type cannot pass through guessed field interpretation. This consumer policy does not itself certify a SLSA level. Ten of 12 records match subject and builder, and seven of those also satisfy parameter and resolved-dependency expectations. Mark each remaining row with an unapproved target or dependency digest rather than a generic failed status. Full-contract admission is 7/12×100, approximately 58.333 percent. Correcting resolved-dependency evidence in two otherwise acceptable rows raises it to 9/12×100=75 percent, without broadening the trusted builder set.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-041","referenceUrls":["https://reproducible-builds.org/docs/source-date-epoch/"],"title":"SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH：UTC、封存時間下限與決定性","titleEn":"SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH: UTC, archive timestamp floors and determinism","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：20%與10%可重算，剩餘未核准產物仍使步驟失敗；重複同keyid不增加獨立門檻。 交付intoto-rule-queue.csv、功能者矩陣與規則順序反例；簽章驗證以公開測試鍵或明示描述代替正式簽章。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 20 and ten percent, fail the step while unapproved products remain, and never increase the independent threshold count with repeated evidence from one key. Deliver intoto-rule-queue.csv, the functionary matrix and ordering counterexamples. Use public test keys or explicitly labeled verification descriptors rather than production signatures.","difference":"建立三個相同內容的本地封存實驗，改變牆鐘、時區與來源時間；逐項保存檔案順序、權限、時間欄及內容摘要。","differenceEn":"Build three local archives with identical contents while varying wall clock, timezone and source epoch. Record entry ordering, permissions, timestamp fields and content digests, separating metadata differences from actual changes in the payload.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["功能者門檻與產物規則是獨立關卡；本課計算未核准產物佔比，所有名稱先正規化且不把同一路徑不同摘要合併。 單一步驟輸出10個產物，其中8個被明訂規則消耗，2個剩餘；兩位有效功能者已滿足門檻且內容一致。 剩餘比例(10−8)/10×100=20%；補上一條僅核准其中一個既定產物的精確規則後剩10%。","本課ZIP實作採1980-01-01 UTC為下限315532800；有效時間取max(來源epoch,下限)，這是特定封存格式的轉換，不可回寫改變原始來源歷史。 來源epoch=300000000秒，ZIP下限315532800；本課只計因格式限制而增加的秒數，不宣稱來源真實發生於1980年。 調整量max(300000000,315532800)−300000000=15532800秒；來源改320000000時調整量0。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Functionary threshold and artifact rules are independent gates. Measure the fraction of unapproved products after path normalization, while retaining different digests for an identical path rather than merging conflicting evidence into a single harmless-looking entry. One step emits ten products, eight consumed by explicit rules and two remaining. Two valid functionaries already satisfy the threshold and agree on contents, isolating artifact-policy completeness from signer-count failure. Remaining fraction is (10−8)/10×100=20 percent. Adding an exact rule approving only one previously reviewed product leaves ten percent, and the final DISALLOW still rejects the remaining unexpected output.","For the selected ZIP implementation use the 1980-01-01 UTC floor of 315532800. Effective timestamp is max(source epoch,floor), a format conversion that must not rewrite the original source history or be generalized to every archive format. Set source epoch to 300000000 seconds with ZIP floor 315532800. Calculate only the adjustment required by this representation, without claiming that the original source event actually occurred at the adjusted archive timestamp. Adjustment is max(300000000, 315532800)−300000000=15532800 seconds. With source epoch 320000000 the adjustment is zero, because the source already lies above the representation floor.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-cc97dd4df85a6cc2","url":"https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-provenance","title":"SLSA v1.2 build provenance","titleEn":"SLSA v1.2 build provenance","publisher":"SLSA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-908a82feae871669","url":"https://reproducible-builds.org/docs/source-date-epoch/","title":"Reproducible Builds: SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH","titleEn":"Reproducible Builds: SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH","publisher":"Reproducible Builds","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
